test('bot routing climbs Depot, Quarry and Fortress ramps instead of treating slopes as walls',()=>{for(const arena of ['depot','quarry','fortress'] as const){const ramp=arena==='fortress'?FORT_RAMPS[0]:EXPANSIONS[arena].ramps[0],scale=ARENA_SCALE[arena],height=ARENA_HEIGHT[arena],s=createState({...config,arena}),k=s.karts[1],foe=s.karts[0],sign=Math.sign(ramp.to-ramp.from);s.ctf=undefined;s.phase='playing';s.boxes.forEach(box=>box.respawn=9999);k.item='shield';k.x=(ramp.axis==='x'?ramp.from:ramp.cross)*scale;k.z=(ramp.axis==='z'?ramp.from:ramp.cross)*scale;k.y=ramp.bottom*height;k.angle=ramp.axis==='x'?sign*Math.PI/2:sign>0?0:Math.PI;k.vx=k.vz=k.speed=0;foe.x=(ramp.axis==='x'?ramp.to+sign:ramp.cross)*scale;foe.z=(ramp.axis==='z'?ramp.to+sign:ramp.cross)*scale;foe.y=ramp.top*height;let reached=false;for(let frame=0;frame<1200;frame++){s.tick++;drive(s,k,{...botInput(s,k),fire:false},1/60);if(k.y>=ramp.top*height-.15){reached=true;break;}}assert.ok(reached,arena+' bot did not climb ramp');}});

